# Normalisasi line ending: semua file teks disimpan LF di repo
# dan ditulis LF di working tree (berlaku di semua OS).
# Tujuan: mencegah `npm run format:check` gagal karena CRLF di Windows,
# terutama setelah clone ulang di mesin baru.
* text=auto eol=lf

# File biner harus tetap apa adanya (tidak pernah dikonversi line ending)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
